For the given code snippet, predict the output. If the typecasting is changed from `int` to `boolean`, what will be the output.

```java
public class typecasting
{
    public static void main(String[] args)
    {
        char ch1, ch2;
        ch1 = 88;
        ch2 = 'Y';
        System.out.print("ch1 and ch2: ");
        System.out.println(ch1 + " " + (int)++ch2);
    }
}
```

